      "value": "@{5e877e5e60de627e6ba7946a|full_name} I don’t think it has, I had a similar issue with a Gumroad avi where the bones just acted static and it made my avi look like she had real bad Bed Hair, and had to adjust phys bones in my Unity project to accommodate the change…\n\n(It’s better than it was after I edited the project file, but the issue is still there and some angles still cause the collider/ static issue)\n\n- I’m not an Avatar Creator though",
